      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "root:system:controllers\n\nDEFINES all four APIExports + their schemas\n\n  \u00b7 tenancy              \u2192  Membership\n  \u00b7 tenancy-platform     \u2192  User, Organization, index\n  \u00b7 tenancy-provisioner  \u2192  claim: workspaces\n  \u00b7 tenancy-access       \u2192  claims: ns \u00b7 RBAC \u00b7 SAs\n\nstores no objects \u2014 every tier binds",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sysctrl",
      "originalText": "root:system:controllers\n\nDEFINES all four APIExports + their schemas\n\n  \u00b7 tenancy              \u2192  Membership\n  \u00b7 tenancy-platform     \u2192  User, Organization, index\n  \u00b7 tenancy-provisioner  \u2192  claim: workspaces\n  \u00b7 tenancy-access       \u2192  claims: ns \u00b7 RBAC \u00b7 SAs\n\nstores no objects \u2014 every tier binds",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
