      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1   create users          self-scoped, empty spec\n                                 idempotent: name = hash(issuer+sub)\n                                 \u2192 the controller takes it from here\n\n2   watch organizations    rows appear as they go Ready;\n                                 User.status.conditions say why if not\n\n3   pick a workspace       \u2192 GET workspaces/<ws>/kubeconfig\n\nno /provision verb \u00b7 no OIDC callback hook \u00b7 reads never write",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1   create users          self-scoped, empty spec\n                                 idempotent: name = hash(issuer+sub)\n                                 \u2192 the controller takes it from here\n\n2   watch organizations    rows appear as they go Ready;\n                                 User.status.conditions say why if not\n\n3   pick a workspace       \u2192 GET workspaces/<ws>/kubeconfig\n\nno /provision verb \u00b7 no OIDC callback hook \u00b7 reads never write",
