      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "READ THIS AS:\n\npurple   DEFINES the exports + schemas\n             \u2014 stores nothing itself\n\ndashed   an APIBinding to one export;\n             every tier is a consumer\n\nSCHEMAS\ntenancy            \u2192  Org tier\ntenancy-platform   \u2192  system tier\n\nCAPABILITIES  (no schemas)\ntenancy-provisioner \u2192  make workspaces\n                               (root:tenants + Orgs)\ntenancy-access      \u2192  write inside one\n                               (child workspaces)\n\nblue      org tier \u2014 Memberships,\n             VW-only, no tenant access\n\ngreen    workspace tier \u2014 tenant work,\n             reached directly at kcp\n\ncyan      object stores; they bind too",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "READ THIS AS:\n\npurple   DEFINES the exports + schemas\n             \u2014 stores nothing itself\n\ndashed   an APIBinding to one export;\n             every tier is a consumer\n\nSCHEMAS\ntenancy            \u2192  Org tier\ntenancy-platform   \u2192  system tier\n\nCAPABILITIES  (no schemas)\ntenancy-provisioner \u2192  make workspaces\n                               (root:tenants + Orgs)\ntenancy-access      \u2192  write inside one\n                               (child workspaces)\n\nblue      org tier \u2014 Memberships,\n             VW-only, no tenant access\n\ngreen    workspace tier \u2014 tenant work,\n             reached directly at kcp\n\ncyan      object stores; they bind too",
